{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29144","headline":"送张厚浙东谒丁常侍 · 许浑","name":"送张厚浙东谒丁常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉露清蝉柳陌空，故人遥指浙江东。\n青山有雪松当涧，碧落无云鹤出笼。\n齐唱离歌愁晚月，独看征棹怨秋风。\n定知洛下声名士，共说膺门得孔融。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}